{'symbol': 'MCO', 'date': '2022-02-02 02:00:00', 'title': "MOODY'S TO ACQUIRE MAJORITY STAKE IN GCR RATINGS, EXPANDING PRESENCE IN AFRICA", 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MOODY'S CORPORATION (NYSE: MCO) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS AGREED TO ACQUIRE A MAJORITY (51%) STAKE IN GLOBAL CREDIT RATING COMPANY LIMITED (GCR). GCR IS A LEADING CREDIT RATING AGENCY IN AFRICA WITH OPERATIONS SPANNING THE CONTINENT, INCLUDING IN SOUTH AFRICA, NIGERIA, SENEGAL, KENYA, AND MAURITIUS. “GCR'S RATINGS PLAY A SIGNIFICANT ROLE IN THE GROWTH OF AFRICA'S FINANCIAL MARKETS BY PROVIDING CRITICAL INSIGHTS INTO CREDIT ACROSS A RANGE OF ECONOMIES AND SECTORS,” S"}